== Paso 7: Centro
  [OK ] Centro: H0(0) = K(0), H1(0) = [2l K(0) + 16 pi G (eps+p) W(0)]/[l(l+1)] y V(0) = -W(0)/l, como en LD, sin corrección axiónica
  [OK ] Centro: X(0) = X_LD(0) + e^{Phi_c}[n dm*/dtheta Delta theta(0) - (8 pi G/3)(eps+p) V(theta_c) W(0)]  -- Delta theta(0) = delta theta(0) + theta_0''(0) W(0)
  [OK ] Centro: delta theta''(0) = Ec. (16c) del Paper II - 3 K(0) theta_0''(0)/(2l+3)

